WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:23.314 --> 00:00:24.482
Ryo!

00:00:28.820 --> 00:00:29.738
Why do you run?

00:00:30.697 --> 00:00:34.576
Your physical ability is nothing,
compared to even cats and dogs.

00:00:34.826 --> 00:00:36.661
You would get eaten by a devil.

00:00:36.745 --> 00:00:38.371
Eaten... Eaten...

00:00:38.997 --> 00:00:40.665
Eaten... Eaten...

00:01:25.960 --> 00:01:26.795
Amon?

00:01:26.878 --> 00:01:28.213
Amon?

00:01:53.029 --> 00:01:56.783
I've made Akira into a devil.

00:01:59.661 --> 00:02:00.495
And...

00:02:01.412 --> 00:02:07.168
I might have created the most powerful,
ruthless, and brutal devil in this world.

